{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ZheXRRFLWj1795739706.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>現代中藥集團大股東兼公司主席孫新磊以超過3,100萬元出售1.44億股。</p><p></p><p>孫新磊透過一名證券經紀，以每股0.217元向多名承配人配售共1.44億股，配售價較公司停牌前作價折讓四成八。交易完成後，孫新磊的持股量由近五成六，降至不足三成六。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T01:43:51.795882+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T00:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T00:37:12.457624+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T01:37:15.527743+00:00","content_hash":"389d9ba41a5c92afab0d5331ce4c08dbc6db1f0264b4a4a9f5bf6a4cdfe5daa0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T01:43:51.795882+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}